# Valley of Mists: dawn in the mountains - a sea of fog in the valleys lifting as the sun comes up, the peaks lit pink, geese crossing, deer grazing below.
film    valley-of-mists
name    Valley of Mists
about   Dawn in the mountains: fog fills the valleys, the first light turns the peaks pink, geese cross overhead and deer graze below as the fog burns away.
scene   film_assets/wild/set.pbrt
length  60
still   20
tags    nature, mountains, fog, dawn, showcase

terrain  mountains  size 3000  height 600  seed 3
sky      5:05 6:35  physical  altitude 900
fog      0.035  lift 30 48
forest   mixed 2600  near 140
flock    geese 9  from -700 260 200  to 600 260 -900
herd     deer 7  from -60 -40  to 40 -60  speed 0.8
exposure auto
timelapse 4

